description:
The Government is seeking information from qualified vendors capable of providing quarterly Opacity Meter Inspections and Servicing at Hanscom Air Force Base (AFB). 

Services include quarterly inspection/service for two (2) Opacity Meters as well as the Data Acquisition Handling System (DAHS)&nbsp;continuous opacity monitoring systems&nbsp;(COMS) located at Hanscom AFB. 

Respondents may include capability statements or brochures detailing their ability to meet this requirement.&nbsp;
